{"path":"skills/comprehende/references/powershell.md","ref":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","side":"new","lines":[{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":1,"text":"# PowerShell"},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":2,"text":""},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":3,"text":"These blocks replace the POSIX blocks of Workflow steps 2 and 4 and of Refresh. Every other block in SKILL.md runs in PowerShell as written: `\"$REVIEW_DIR/review.json\"` expands the same way in both shells. `<cli>` is the CLI command SKILL.md uses: the pinned `npx` command, or the local executable the user named. The blocks run in Windows PowerShell 5.1 and in PowerShell 7."},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":4,"text":""},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":5,"text":"- Each block starts with `[Console]::OutputEncoding = [Text.Encoding]::UTF8`, so paths and commit subjects print as git wrote them."},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":6,"text":"- Read files with `Get-Content -Raw -Encoding UTF8`. Write files with `[IO.File]::WriteAllText`; it writes UTF-8 with no BOM."},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":7,"text":"- When the execution policy blocks `npx.ps1`, call `npx.cmd`."},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":8,"text":""},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":9,"text":"## Workflow step 2"},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":10,"text":""},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":11,"text":"The `if ($LASTEXITCODE -eq 0)` checks stop the block before `pregroup` when a ref does not resolve."},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":12,"text":""},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":13,"text":"```powershell"},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":14,"text":"[Console]::OutputEncoding = [Text.Encoding]::UTF8"},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":15,"text":"$REVIEW_DIR = Join-Path ([IO.Path]::GetTempPath()) \"comprehende-$([guid]::NewGuid())\""},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":16,"text":"New-Item -ItemType Directory $REVIEW_DIR | Out-Null"},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":17,"text":"git rev-parse --verify --end-of-options \"<base>^{commit}\""},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":18,"text":"if ($LASTEXITCODE -eq 0) { git rev-parse --verify --end-of-options \"<head>^{commit}\" }"},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":19,"text":"if ($LASTEXITCODE -eq 0) {"},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":20,"text":"  npm view comprehende version"},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":21,"text":"  <cli> pregroup --base <base> --head <head> --data \"$REVIEW_DIR/review.json\""},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":22,"text":"  <cli> digest --base <base> --head <head>"},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":23,"text":"  Get-Content -Raw -Encoding UTF8 \"$REVIEW_DIR/review.json\""},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":24,"text":"  git log --format=%s --end-of-options <base>..<head>"},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":25,"text":"  foreach ($text in @((<fetch the request body> | Out-String), (<fetch the review comments> | Out-String))) {"},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":26,"text":"    $text.Substring(0, [Math]::Min(10000, $text.Length))"},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":27,"text":"  }"},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":28,"text":"}"},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":29,"text":"```"},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":30,"text":""},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":31,"text":"## Workflow step 4"},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":32,"text":""},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":33,"text":"A single-quoted here-string keeps `$` and backticks as text. The closing `'@` starts its line."},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":34,"text":""},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":35,"text":"```powershell"},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":36,"text":"[Console]::OutputEncoding = [Text.Encoding]::UTF8"},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":37,"text":"$document = @'"},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":38,"text":"<the document>"},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":39,"text":"'@"},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":40,"text":"[IO.File]::WriteAllText(\"$REVIEW_DIR/review.json\", $document)"},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":41,"text":"<cli> validate --data \"$REVIEW_DIR/review.json\""},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":42,"text":"```"},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":43,"text":""},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":44,"text":"## Refresh: copy the previous document"},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":45,"text":""},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":46,"text":"```powershell"},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":47,"text":"$REVIEW_DIR = Join-Path ([IO.Path]::GetTempPath()) \"comprehende-$([guid]::NewGuid())\""},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":48,"text":"New-Item -ItemType Directory $REVIEW_DIR | Out-Null"},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":49,"text":"$REVIEW_DIR"},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":50,"text":"node -e \"fetch(process.argv[1]).then((r) => { if (!r.ok) throw new Error(r.status); return r.json(); }).then((j) => require('fs').writeFileSync(process.argv[2], JSON.stringify(j.document, null, 2)))\" \"<site-url>/api/review.json\" \"$REVIEW_DIR/review.json\""},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":51,"text":"```"},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":52,"text":""},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":53,"text":"## Refresh step 1"},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":54,"text":""},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":55,"text":"```powershell"},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":56,"text":"[Console]::OutputEncoding = [Text.Encoding]::UTF8"},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":57,"text":"git fetch --quiet <remote>"},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":58,"text":"if ($LASTEXITCODE -eq 0) {"},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":59,"text":"  <cli> refresh --data \"$REVIEW_DIR/review.json\""},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":60,"text":"  Get-Content -Raw -Encoding UTF8 \"$REVIEW_DIR/review.json\""},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":61,"text":"}"},{"sha":"69c1fc567d28c71ac354b6250d2159ce66820a5a","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793185680,"line":62,"text":"```"}]}
